. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
. * 2_MakeQWI_2018_09_18.do  ->  QWI_2018_09_18.dta   (county QWI wage/employme
> nt measures)
. *
. * STAGE 2 of the 3-stage QWI chain. Keeps county-level (geo_level=="C") rows,
>  maps NAICS
. * sector codes to short tags, reshapes wide by industry, then builds the QWI 
> wage measures
. * (qwiw1-4 stable-job earnings, qwi_wnh/wah/wtot, the f-suffixed "significant
> -flag" variants)
. * and sector employment (qwi_emp_*, qwif_emp_*) for five industries.
. *
. * SECTOR NOTE: the wage/emp loops run over "all" "ret" "foo" "art" "man". The
>  downstream
. * consumers are ALL (everywhere) and RET + FOO (non-tradable sector shares, t
> able in the
. * TeX near L1090). MAN and "art" are also constructed and retained in the ~30
> -column output.
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
. clear all

. set more off

. 
. global QWIRAW "${rawdata}/QWI"

. cd "${QWIRAW}"
